  "knownIssues": [
    "Play solo: choose Offline on PEAK's start screen. In a lobby, other players see your scout slide about stiffly.",
    "PEAK's own sound can go quiet while Minecraft has the scout.",
    "Digging into the mountain itself has had little testing.",
    "Blocks you place don't carry over to the next climb: each one starts a fresh Minecraft world.",
    "Keys 6, 7 and 8 use the scout's own three item slots; F picks things up and opens luggage.",
    "Only one Minecraft X Games mashup can run at a time: they all drive the same kind of hidden Minecraft.",
    "A prototype: expect rough edges."
  ]
}
